# break: header and delimiter disagree

Header has 2 cells, delimiter has 4. GFM does not recognize a table at all;
this renders as a paragraph of pipes.

EXPECT: rumdl HIT (MD056), markdownlint SILENT.

markdownlint goes silent because its parser stops seeing a table, so MD056
has nothing to check. If markdownlint starts hitting this, it may have gained
break detection — re-read whether the pair is still needed.

| A | B |
| - | - | - | - |
